Hello all,

 =


Please find the test report of oFono v1.12 commit b131cfd.

 =


During this testing, we ran 34 functional positive cases. 31 cases passed, 0
failed and 3 are blocked (due to expiration of network simulator license,
renewal have been ordered). No new issue has been found.

 =


If you have any comment about this report, tell me please.

 =


 =


Test Objective

 =


As there was only specific changes (for SIMCOM/sim900) since the previous
tests cycle, the aim of this session was to validate the state of oFono
upstream by testing only major tests of most important features over all
material we had (according to what feature was supported and by priority
order: PR3, Network Simulator, 3G dongle, phonesim). oFono has been
installed and tested on smartphone running Tizen 2.0 and Ubuntu 12.04
device.

